        "original_id": "1480e090-0eb1-5562-ae44-a465b929f43f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tetrahydrogestrinone (THG), The Clear\n- People: Dwain Chambers\n- Topics: anabolic-androgenic steroids, doping in athletics\n\nFacts:\n- Tetrahydrogestrinone (THG), also called The Clear, is a synthetic, orally active anabolic-androgenic steroid that was never marketed.\n- Dwain Anthony Chambers, born on 5 April 1978, is a retired British track sprinter.\n- In 2003, Dwain Chambers received a two-year athletics ban after testing positive for THG, a banned performance-enhancing drug.\n- Dwain Chambers won international medals at World and European level and became one of the fastest European sprinters in athletics history.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
